sequenceDiagram
    participant P as Application Pod
    participant S as AWS SDK
    participant A as Pod Identity component
    participant E as EKS identity service
    participant T as AWS STS
    participant D as DynamoDB

    P->>S: PutItem
    S->>A: Request container credentials
    A->>E: Present Pod identity token
    E->>T: Assume associated IAM role
    T-->>E: Temporary credentials
    E-->>A: Scoped credentials
    A-->>S: Rotating credentials
    S->>D: SigV4-signed PutItem
    D-->>S: IAM-authorized response
